  <text>
    <body>
      <p>Mrs Delia Larkin is listed as the proprietor of the <ref target="civic?id=Corkman%20Hotel">Carlton Inn</ref> at 160 Leicester Street in the directories in 1915 and 1920 (spelt "Della" in 1920).</p>
      <p>She is on the 1919 electoral roll at 160 Leicester Street, a hotelkeeper.</p>
      <p>See also <ref target="civic?id=Corkman%20Hotel">Carlton Inn</ref> and <ref target="civic?id=Hotels">Hotels</ref>.</p>
    </body>
